OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after woman, 33, dies in
OL,4,Athree-car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old woman has died and a man
OL,7,Fremains in hospital following a road
OL,8,Fcrash involving three cars, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe collision, involving a black
OL,12,FPerodua Myvi hatchback, a blue Skoda
OL,13,FKamiq and a white Hyundai i30, took
OL,14,Fplace on the A381 in Halwell, near
OL,15,FTotnes, Devon, shortly before 20:00 BST
OL,16,Fon Tuesday.
OL,18,FDevon and Cornwall Police said the
OL,19,Fwoman, from the area and who was the
OL,20,Fdriver of the Perodua, died at the
OL,21,Fscene, while the driver of the Skoda
OL,22,Fremained in a critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
