OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after woman, 33, dies in
OL,4,Athree-car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s, who was driving the
OL,7,FHyundai, was arrested for failing to
OL,8,Fprovide a sample for a preliminary
OL,9,Fdrugs test and was treated for minor
OL,10,Finjuries, officers said.
